Package: RSqlClientNET
Title: SQL Server DBI Backend Using 'Microsoft.Data.SqlClient'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tonny Studsgaard", "Petersen", email = "tsp@person.dk", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides a 'DBI' backend for Microsoft SQL Server via a
    persistent '.NET' helper running 'Microsoft.Data.SqlClient' and a native
    'Rcpp' binary transport. Supports parameterized queries, paged result
    fetching, transactions, metadata, temporary tables, and high-throughput
    'SqlBulkCopy' table uploads. Provides configurable conversion of SQL
    decimal, 64-bit integer, binary, and timestamp values, including optional
    disambiguation of repeated local times at daylight-saving transitions.
    Developed through AI-assisted (vibe-coded) programming with GPT-6 SOL
    (high thinking effort), with human testing and maintenance by Tonny
    Studsgaard Petersen.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
